            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "About the Kamera...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718110503"
            ]
          },
          "718110503": {
            "id": "718110503",
            "speakerId": 2092,
            "speakerName": "Granny Shan",
            "text": "Kamera... Ah, yes, I did go to the Feiyun Commerce Guild a few days ago — asked them to come here to take a picture of me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718110504"
            ]
          },
          "718110504": {
            "id": "718110504",
            "speakerId": 2092,
            "speakerName": "Granny Shan",
            "text": "Did you come here specially to deliver my picture? Why, thank you. Thank you very much."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7181104",
      "subQuestName": "Deliver the picture to the customer",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718110601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718110601": {
            "id": "718110601",
            "speakerId": 2010,
            "speakerName": "Tea Master Liu Su",
            "text": "Is something the matter?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718110602"
            ]
          },
          "718110602": {
            "id": "718110602",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "About the Kamera...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718110603"
            ]
          },
          "718110603": {
            "id": "718110603",
            "speakerId": 2010,
            "speakerName": "Tea Master Liu Su",
            "text": "Ah, right, right. I did go to Feiyun Commerce Guild to request that they take a picture of me here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718110604"
            ]
          },
          "718110604": {
            "id": "718110604",
            "speakerId": 2010,
            "speakerName": "Tea Master Liu Su",
            "text": "How is it? Has the picture been printed already? Let me have a look at it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718110605"
            ]
          },
          "718110605": {
            "id": "718110605",
            "speakerId": 2010,
            "speakerName": "Tea Master Liu Su",
            "text": "Oh, this is not bad at all. Thank you for making the trip here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7181107",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Xu",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718110412"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718110412": {
            "id": "718110412",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "About the Kamera...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718110401"
            ]
          },
          "718110401": {
            "id": "718110401",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "Xu",
            "text": "Have you managed to deliver the pictures?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718110402"
            ]
          },
          "718110402": {
            "id": "718110402",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Done deal.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718110403"
            ]
          },
          "718110403": {
            "id": "718110403",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "Xu",
            "text": "Thank you, thank you. I'm sorry for troubling you, but we're barely keeping our heads above the water here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718110404"
            ]
          },
          "718110404": {
            "id": "718110404",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "Xu",
            "text": "Ah, yes. Please take this Kamera as thanks for your help.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718110407"
            ]
          },
          "718110407": {
            "id": "718110407",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "Xu",
            "text": "It's no problem. I mean, you did help us, didn't you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718110408"
            ]
          },
          "718110408": {
            "id": "718110408",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "Xu",
            "text": "This is not an exceedingly expensive object, either. It's just a sample that our partners in Fontaine gave us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718110409"
            ]
          },
          "718110409": {
            "id": "718110409",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "Xu",
            "text": "There are some differences between it and the official model... but the basic functions are all there. It'll definitely be enough for your needs.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718110410"
            ]
          },
          "718110410": {
            "id": "718110410",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "Xu",
            "text": "And if you take a liking to it, you can also help us with some advertising here and there...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718110411"
            ]
          },
          "718110411": {
            "id": "718110411",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "Xu",
            "text": "Ahem... Regardless, thanks for your help, and please, take this Kamera with you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
